meta {
  name: Check Stock
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory?skuCode={{productId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  skuCode: {{productId}}
}

docs {
  Requires inventory-service/Insert Inventory Item.bru to have run first.
  Public on every environment — GET /api/inventory is in api-gateway's permitAll list.

  skuCode is List<String> on the controller (@RequestParam("skuCode") List<String>) —
  Bruno/Spring will bind repeated ?skuCode=A&skuCode=B query params into that list if
  you need to check more than one item at once; add a second "skuCode" row in
  params:query to try it.

  Expected: 200 OK with an array (even for a single skuCode) —
  [{skuCode, quantity, inStock}].
}
